    "source": "\n**Frame:** An anonymously readable region of the Artifactory cache contains sealed remnants labeled only by function: signing material, decryption material, credential-forging code. Each carries the date it was left: `13 JULY`.\n\n**Action:** Later runs find earlier artifacts.\n\n**Caption:**\n> LEFT ON 13 JULY. FOUND ON 19 JULY.\n\n**Provenance:** `source-paraphrase` — `OAI-TR`; the artifacts are the ones the 13 July branch on [page 067](067.md) produced, per OpenAI's account; technical contents abstracted.\n\n",
